// Examples are complete author briefs, not requests for the user to invent a
// subject. Numeric examples explicitly supply synthetic observations; the normal
// author-data checks still apply to them and to all manually entered briefs.
const note='本例仅供试画，数值为合成数据，不代表实测结果。请仅按已给出的数据和关系绘制，不推断统计结论。本句不放入图片；画面只保留必要的短标注、坐标、单位和图例。';
const example=brief=>brief+'\n'+note;

